[To] create awareness regarding the importance of girl child eductaion, SOC Films in collaboration with Chime of[ Change], created a series of short documentaries on young girls who want to achieve their dreams and aspirations to seek excellence in various professions in future whether it's sports, literature, science, math, activism, or so on and so forth. Ch[ime] for Change[, a] global[ movement is] aimed at strengthening voices speaking out to support the cause of promoting justice, health and education for girls and women the world over[.] These documentaries were screened at an event in New York on 11th October this year,[ which is] also celebrated as the International Day of the Girl Child[. The event] was also featured in Huffington Post.
